.TH AVR\-ARTIFACT\-DOWNLOAD 1 "" "avr 0.4.1" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-artifact-download \- Download ART_ID and verify its size and SHA-256 before replacing the destination.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr artifact download
[OPTIONS] ART_ID
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download ART_ID and verify its size and SHA-256 before replacing the destination.
.PP
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIARTIFACT_ID\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug; defaults to the configured organization.
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository name or ID; defaults to the current git repository.
.TP
\fB\-\-path\fR \fIPATH\fR
Destination directory or filename. ZIPs stay archived. (default: .)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-artifact (1),
.BR avr-artifact-delete (1),
.BR avr-artifact-get (1),
.BR avr-artifact-list (1)
